{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "3b6f52f08cbb7984f112dc3072f8e04afb691eddaa153c492ba05c440f895aa6", "ja": "兄ちゃん……決まったよ、将来の夢。\n真美は宇宙飛行士を目指すことにする！", "zh": "哥哥……我决定好了，未来的梦想。\n真美要以成为宇航员为目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8a72883686f30b694e2e15bced3ea14609bb9359e9b5892f5c278144182f85b7", "ja": "宇宙飛行士？　また突然だな、\n今度は何に影響を受けたのか……。", "zh": "宇航员？这也太突然了吧，\n这次又是受了什么影响啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "8d8362b1f8e4e40e45cc6e365651eaf6c9283459f96f4bef94be10b0d2509106", "ja": "んっふっふ～。真美、気づいちゃったんだよね！\nもはや真美のスケールは地球サイズには収まらないと！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～。真美已经注意到了哦！\n现在的真美，规模早已不是区区地球容得下的了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1003_p", "source_sha256": "27aa8f42bf6cfa4a062294fcd5b6c6bae14123b25936d66382a971c88f1a6bd1", "ja": "まあ、夢を持つことはいいと思うけど……\nアイドルはどうするんだ？", "zh": "拥有梦想倒是挺好的……\n不过偶像工作你打算怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "982ebcedca8bbf5b694ab1f52f47338711239f1f850fd14b0e2fcbc25795fde0", "ja": "もちろん、アイドルも続けるに決まってるっしょ！\n目指せ、史上初の宇宙飛行士系アイドルだよ！", "zh": "当然也要继续当偶像啊，这不是明摆着的吗！\n目标是成为史上首位宇航员系偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "97536abfdf940bcf985050097a4b8621e3d4dcc36971dd251ac8c4cb7e37f432", "ja": "そして真美は、宇宙で初めてライブをした\nアイドルとして、歴史に名を残すのであった……。", "zh": "于是，真美作为首位在宇宙举办演出的偶像，载入了史册……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3f5cb98bff73855503c28feb7b15a7d6e05e8afb7a34111bde7aaf326910a3d6", "ja": "はは、それはすごいな。宇宙でライブか。\n……案外、真美なら実現しちゃいかねないな。", "zh": "哈哈，那可真厉害啊。在宇宙里举办演唱会吗？\n……说不定，真美还真能把它实现呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "23f2c7b7cb6b284301e4c054403ccacf65fef2b8f29505f2ccf8553fb661a8cc", "ja": "でしょ！　てことで兄ちゃんも、\nその時に備えて、しっかり準備しといてね♪", "zh": "对吧！所以哥哥也要为那时候做好充分准备哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4168c60c1aeae6029f7e881988e21f866b2fc7780cbe7fe388cd739d4d6c8351", "ja": "えっ、まさか一緒に行くのか？", "zh": "诶，难道要一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0462_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0462_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "63bbeb8e3b1a5e9192b78c041621396cb5398e47465ce8b6816d8a8167c41e64", "ja": "当然っしょ！　そのアカツキには、兄ちゃんは\n人類初の、宇宙飛行士系プロデューサーだよ♪", "zh": "那当然啦！到那时候，老哥可就是\n全人类首位宇航员系制作人啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
